  "Waiting for both players. The timer is still running.": ["Waiting for both players. The timer is still running.","En attente des deux joueurs. Le chrono continue.","Esperando a ambos jugadores. El reloj sigue.","Warte auf beide Spieler. Die Zeit läuft weiter.","In attesa di entrambi. Il tempo continua.","Aguardando os dois jogadores. O relógio continua.","二人がそろうまで待機中です。タイマーは進みます。","두 플레이어를 기다리는 중이에요. 시간은 계속 흘러요.","正在等待两位玩家。计时仍在继续。","Ждём обоих игроков. Таймер продолжает идти."],
