  "I am learning my first words.": ["I am learning my first words.","J’apprends mes premiers mots.","Estoy aprendiendo mis primeras palabras.","Ich lerne meine ersten Wörter.","Sto imparando le prime parole.","Estou aprendendo minhas primeiras palavras.","最初の単語を覚えているところです。","기초 단어를 배우고 있어요.","我正在学习最基础的词汇。","Я учу первые слова."],
  "I can use a few simple phrases.": ["I can use a few simple phrases.","Je peux employer quelques phrases simples.","Puedo usar algunas frases sencillas.","Ich kann ein paar einfache Sätze sagen.","So usare qualche frase semplice.","Consigo usar algumas frases simples.","簡単なフレーズをいくつか使えます。","간단한 표현을 몇 가지 쓸 수 있어요.","我会用几句简单的表达。","Я могу сказать несколько простых фраз."],
